summary:
Main objective: Part 1A: Evaluate the overall safety and tolerability of ATX-898 administered as monotherapy and determine the MTD (or maximum tested dose) and recommended dose for expansion (RDE);
Part 1B: Assess the antitumor activity of ATX-898 administered as monotherapy in participants in each expansion cohort;
Part 2A: Determine the RDE of ATX-898 in combination with fulvestrant and abemaciclib (Part 2A1) and/or fulvestrant and ribociclib (Part 2A2);
Part 2B: Further assess the antitumor activity of ATX-898 at the combination RDE in combination with fulvestrant and abemaciclib (Part 2B1) and/or ribociclib (Part 2B2)
